{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'If Captain Finn feels up to it, he's definitely one to ask...' she turns to Roy. 'I hate to ask you this, but... can that backpack of yours carry a body? If we go with... old me... as bait, I'd rather take the body away from the grove, but I'm not sure where would be good.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:43:01.105000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868820634220777502","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You were taller than I am. I don't think it would've fit in the backpack. Maybe instead we could lead her to there? It's not just your body that's there, and the Ravens are gone. I don't intend for her to get anywhere near, but maybe just that fact would be tempting enough.\"\n\n\"Let's check with some other people first, I'd say. Maybe those with more experience dealing with Heore would be able to improve on that idea.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T11:47:04.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868821653520531466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
