{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Hard call, because quite a few people are fond of her for buying these essences. And of him for paying well for errands. Could use the help of people who know her a bit, but aren't too close. The lamplighters are focused on Kingsbridge right now, especially with Ravens gone. Ed Harkness, maybe. Sonny, Fuddles, Finn? Eldon, potentially?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T15:38:49.169000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868879975502205008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
