{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Maybe Secel, too? Can't hurt to have a holy woman around, with the chance for undead... and I can't see her wanting anything positive to do with *him*.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T15:47:22.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868882130279751721","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
